#: ../../contributing.rst:327
msgid ""
"This command uses tox’s explicit ``integration`` environment and hits the"
" `cPanel UAPI REST interface`_ with many of the functions implemented in "
"**cpanel-cli**. Tests that cannot run because the account lacks suitable "
"data must use ``skipTest()`` so the omission is visible."
